Link the WSR track and playback engines statically with isolated global state.

Like Nosefart, WSR otherwise installs three ordinary ELF helper libraries.
Preserve separate track-scanning and alternating playback engines without
requiring dlopen or adding a private native dependency contract.
Upstream: PS5-only native packaging integration.

